<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40889" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσκοπ-ος</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>hitting the mark, successful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλειν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				11.143a
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοξότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Him.
					<u>Ecl.</u>
					14.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.42
				</span></i>
			; <i>reaching, touching</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκης μὴ κακῆς ἐπίσκοπα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					903
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτηστῆσδ᾽ ἐ. μέλος</span>
			<i>having regard to</i> the calamity, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				976
			</span></i>: neut. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσκοπα</span>, as
				Adv., <i>successfully, with</i>
			<i>goodaim</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.τοξεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.35
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.11c
			</span></i>: regul.Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως, ἀκοντίζειν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ τοξεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcid.
					<u>Soph.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.205
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερα, βάλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					8.116b
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					1.215
				</span></i>
			. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστοχος,
		εὔσκοπος</span>.</div>
